"Check downloaded music, podcasts, movies, maps, and other offline content inside the app that created it. Removing a download is often safer than deleting the account item or library entry." = "檢查下載的音樂、播客、電影、地圖和創建它的應用程式內的其他離線內容。刪除下載通常比刪除帳戶項目或庫條目更安全。";
