"Convert imports a working copy into the app. Clearing the conversion workspace removes app-managed copies and outputs, so export anything you want to keep first." = "Convert 將工作副本匯入應用程式。清除轉換工作區會刪除應用程式管理的副本和輸出，因此請先匯出要保留的所有內容。";
"Convert keeps imported working copies and outputs inside app-managed storage. The original outside the app is not replaced. Clear the workspace only after exporting results you want to keep." = "Convert 將匯入的工作副本和輸出保留在應用程式管理的儲存中。應用程式外的原始內容不會被替換。僅在匯出要保留的結果後才清除工作區。";
"Deleted content may remain in Recently Deleted, and iOS storage totals can take time to recalculate. Check the relevant Recently Deleted location, then recheck iPhone Storage later." = "已​​刪除的內容可能會保留在「最近刪除」中，並且 iOS 儲存總量可能需要一些時間才能重新計算。檢查相關的「最近刪除」位置，然後稍後重新檢查 iPhone 儲存空間。";
"Deleted items move to Recently Deleted and may continue using storage until permanently removed. If iCloud Photos is enabled, deletion also syncs to your other devices." = "已刪除的項目將移至“最近刪除”，並可能繼續使用儲存空間，直到永久刪除。如果啟用了 iCloud 照片，刪除也會同步到您的其他裝置。";
"Deleting and reinstalling can remove local-only data and login state. Use it only when the app's data is synced or backed up and its own cleanup controls are not enough." = "刪除並重新安裝可刪除僅限本機的資料和登入狀態。僅當應用程式的資料已同步或備份且其自身的清理控制項不夠時才使用它。";
"Deletion stays user controlled" = "刪除由使用者控制";
"Device storage is not iCloud storage" = "裝置存儲不是 iCloud 存儲";
"Do not install profiles, grant unknown computer access, or erase the iPhone for a promised one-tap cache cleanup. Back up important data before any system reset." = "請勿安裝設定檔、授予未知電腦存取權限或擦除 iPhone 以實現承諾的一鍵式快取清理。在任何系統重置之前備份重要資料。";
"Does analysis or conversion upload my files?" = "分析或轉換會上傳我的檔案嗎？";
"Explore the results" = "探索結果";
"Files deleted from an authorized folder may not be recoverable. The app cannot promise that they will appear in Recently Deleted." = "從授權資料夾中刪除的檔案可能無法復原。該應用程式不能保證它們會出現在「最近刪除」中。";
