"Finish only when you are certain" = "僅當您確定時才完成";
"Folder permission" = "資料夾權限";
"For an iCloud Drive item, use Remove Download in Files when you only want to remove its local copy. The Storage tool does not replace this system action." = "對於 iCloud Drive 項目，當您只想刪除其本機副本時，請使用「刪除檔案中的下載」。儲存工具不會取代此系統操作。";
