"Full Access lets Media analyze the whole library. Limited Access includes only the photos and videos you selected in the system permission sheet." = "完全存取權讓媒體可以分析整個庫。受限存取僅包括您在系統權限表中選擇的照片和影片。";
"Help" = "協助";
"How can we help?" = "需要什麼協助？";
"Import your files" = "匯入您的文件";
"Imported copies and converted outputs use space inside the app. Clear completed work when you no longer need it, after exporting any result you want to keep." = "導入的副本和轉換的輸出使用應用程式內的空間。匯出您想要保留的任何結果後，當您不再需要已完成的工作時，請將其清除。";
"In Files, confirm whether an item is under On My iPhone, iCloud Drive, or another provider. The same action can have different recovery and sync behavior in each location." = "在「檔案」中，確認某個項目是否位於「我的 iPhone」、iCloud Drive 或其他提供者下。相同的操作在每個位置可能有不同的恢復和同步行為。";
"In iPhone Storage, Offload App removes the app but keeps its documents and data. Delete App removes the app and its local data, so verify sync or backup before choosing it." = "在 iPhone 儲存中，卸載應用程式會刪除該應用程序，但保留其文件和資料。刪除應用程式會刪除應用程式及其本機數據，因此在選擇之前請先驗證同步或備份。";
"Install the latest iOS update, restart the iPhone, review Safari data and offline downloads, then let iPhone Storage recalculate. If an unusually large total persists, contact Apple Support." = "安裝最新的 iOS 更新，重新啟動 iPhone，查看 Safari 資料和離線下載，然後讓 iPhone 儲存空間重新計算。如果總數仍然異常大，請聯絡 Apple 支援。";
"Know when to remove a download and when to delete a file." = "瞭解何時移除下載、何時刪除檔案。";
"Large Messages attachments" = "大郵件附件";
"Learn how to use the app and safely free up iPhone storage." = "瞭解如何使用 App 並安全釋放 iPhone 儲存空間。";
"Learn the app, understand what uses storage, and make careful cleanup decisions." = "瞭解 App、找出佔用空間的內容，並謹慎清理。";
"Learn why third-party cleaners cannot directly remove this category." = "瞭解第三方清理工具為何無法直接移除此類別。";
"Let the scan finish" = "讓掃描完成";
"Local by design" = "在地化設計";
"Manage Apps & Downloads" = "管理 App 與下載項目";
"Manage Files & iCloud Drive" = "管理檔案與 iCloud Drive";
"Manage conversion storage" = "管理轉換存儲";
"Media analysis, folder scanning, and conversion happen on this device. The app does not upload your files for these features." = "媒體分析、資料夾掃描和轉換在此裝置上進行。該應用程式不會上傳這些功能的檔案。";
"Media analyzes photos and videos that you allow through the Photos library. Storage analyzes only a folder you choose. Convert works with copies imported into the app's private workspace." = "媒體會分析你在照片圖庫中授權的照片和影片。儲存只會分析你選擇的資料夾。轉換會處理匯入 App 私有工作區的副本。";
"Media needs Photos access to display and analyze library items. You can choose Full Access, Limited Access, or no access, and change the choice later in System Settings." = "媒體需要存取照片來顯示和分析庫項目。您可以選擇完全訪問、有限訪問或無訪問，並稍後在系統設定中變更選擇。";
"Meet the App" = "認識 App";
"No. It can analyze the Photos items you authorize, the folder you choose, and its own conversion workspace. Other apps and protected system storage remain private." = "不。它可以分析您授權的照片項目、您選擇的資料夾以及它自己的轉換工作區。其他應用程式和受保護的系統儲存保持私有。";
"No. Media analysis, folder analysis, and conversion run on this device. Apple services or file providers may sync their own content according to your existing settings." = "否。媒體分析、資料夾分析和轉換在此設備上運行。 Apple 服務或文件提供者可能會根據您的現有設定同步他們自己的內容。";
"Not necessarily. They are visually related candidates and can include different frames, edits, or resolutions. Always compare them before selecting one to remove." = "不一定。它們是視覺相關的候選者，可以包含不同的框架、編輯或解析度。在選擇要刪除的一項之前，請務必對它們進行比較。";
"Offload or delete" = "卸載或刪除";
"Only the items selected in the system permission sheet are available. Counts, groups, and recommendations cannot include the rest of the library." = "僅系統權限表中所選的項目可用。計數、分組和推薦不能包括庫的其餘部分。";
"Open Media" = "開啟媒體";
"Open a category" = "打开类别";
"Open before removing" = "刪除前打開";
"Open iPhone Storage" = "開啟iPhone儲存空間";
"Opens Apple Support in your browser." = "在瀏覽器中開啟 Apple 支援。";
"Permissions & Privacy" = "權限與隱私權";
"Photos and some Files locations may offer Recently Deleted. A file removed through Storage may not be recoverable, so preview important items and keep a backup before deletion." = "照片和某些檔案位置可能會提供「最近刪除」。透過儲存刪除的檔案可能無法恢復，因此在刪除之前預覽重要項目並保留備份。";
"Photos keeps deleted items in Recently Deleted for recovery. They can still occupy space until removed permanently, so empty that album only after confirming you no longer need the files." = "照片將已刪除的項目保留在「最近刪除」中以供恢復。它們仍然會佔用空間，直到永久刪除，因此只有在確認您不再需要這些檔案後才清空該相簿。";
"Photos permission" = "照片許可";
"Quick Start" = "快速開始";
"Recheck after cleanup" = "清理後重新檢查";
"Reduce app storage without expecting a universal cache cleaner." = "減少 App 佔用的空間，但不要期待通用快取清理器。";
"Remove Download and Delete are different" = "刪除 下載和刪除是不同的";
"Remove Download frees the local copy but keeps the file in iCloud Drive. Delete removes the file from iCloud Drive and synced devices." = "刪除下載會釋放本機副本，但將檔案保留在 iCloud Drive 中。刪除會從 iCloud Drive 和同步裝置中刪除檔案。";
"Remove offline downloads first" = "先刪除離線下載";
"Review before deleting" = "刪除前檢查";
"Review large videos, screenshots, and similar photos safely." = "安全檢視大型影片、螢幕截圖與相似照片。";
"Review long videos, 4K videos, screen recordings, and large screenshots first. Similar-photo groups can help you compare bursts or repeated shots, but you should choose the keeper yourself." = "先回顧長影片、4K影片、錄影、大截圖。相似照片組可以幫助您比較連拍或重複拍攝，但您應該自己選擇守門員。";
"Review output settings" = "查看輸出設定";
"Review photos, similar items, screenshots, Live Photos, and videos." = "檢視照片、相似項目、螢幕截圖、Live Photos 與影片。";
"Safari website data" = "Safari 網站數據";
"Safe steps to try" = "可以嘗試的安全步驟";
"Save the result" = "儲存結果";
"Scan a folder you choose and explore its file distribution." = "掃描所選資料夾並檢視檔案分布。";
"Scan and explore" = "掃描並探索";
"Scanning and analysis never delete content. Removal begins only after you select items and confirm the action." = "掃描和分析不會刪除內容。僅在您選擇項目並確認操作後才會開始刪除。";
"See why each permission is needed and how your files are protected." = "了解為什麼需要每個權限以及如何保護您的檔案。";
"Similar does not mean identical" = "相似不代表相同";
"Similar-photo groups are review suggestions, not proof that files are exact duplicates. Keep the best shot before deleting anything." = "相似照片組是審核建議，而不是證明文件完全重複的證據。在刪除任何內容之前保留最好的鏡頭。";
"Start analysis" = "开始分析";
"Start conversion" = "開始轉換";
"Start with high-impact items" = "從高影響力的專案開始";
"Start with iPhone Storage" = "從 iPhone 儲存空間開始";
"Step %lld" = "步驟 %lld";
"Storage asks you to choose a folder because iOS does not grant automatic access to all files. Access can expire or change when a file provider becomes unavailable." = "儲存空間要求您選擇資料夾，因為 iOS 不授予對所有檔案的自動存取權限。當文件提供者不可用時，存取權限可能會過期或變更。";
"Storage can read only the folder you select in the system file picker. The analyzed total describes that folder, not all storage used by the iPhone." = "儲存空間只能讀取您在系統檔案選擇器中選擇的資料夾。分析的總數描述了該資料夾，而不是 iPhone 使用的所有儲存空間。";
"Storage deletes a confirmed file inside the folder you authorized. Recovery depends on the location and file provider, and is not guaranteed." = "儲存可刪除您授權的資料夾內已確認的檔案。恢復取決於位置和文件提供者，並且不能保證。";
"Support" = "支援";
"System Data can include temporary files and resources that iOS creates and removes as needed. The total can change while the storage screen recalculates." = "系統資料可以包括iOS根據需要建立和刪除的臨時檔案和資源。當儲存螢幕重新計算時，總數可能會發生變化。";
"System Data is managed by iOS" = "系統資料由iOS管理";
"The app cannot clear other apps' private data" = "該應用程式無法清除其他應用程式的隱私數據";
"The app cannot inspect or delete iOS caches, logs, updates, or other protected System Data. No third-party app has general access to that storage." = "應用程式無法檢查或刪除iOS快取、日誌、更新或其他受保護的系統資料。沒有第三方應用程式可以存取該儲存。";
"The app cannot read Messages or Safari data. Follow the system controls and review their sync and sign-in effects before deleting." = "該應用程式無法讀取訊息或 Safari 資料。在刪除之前，請遵循系統控制並檢查其同步和登入效果。";
"The app never deletes files automatically. You choose what to review and confirm every cleanup action." = "該應用程式永遠不會自動刪除檔案。您選擇要查看的內容並確認每個清理操作。";
"The app reports only authorized content and can estimate some media sizes without downloading originals. The iPhone Storage total also includes apps, system data, caches, and content outside that scope." = "該應用程式僅報告授權內容，並且可以在不下載原件的情況下估計某些媒體大小。 iPhone 儲存總量還包括應用程式、系統資料、快取以及該範圍之外的內容。";
"The original may not be downloaded, the provider may be offline, or permission may have changed. Download it in the owning app or Files, then try again." = "原件可能無法下載，提供者可能已離線，或權限可能已更改。在所屬應用程式或檔案中下載它，然後重試。";
"The original stays where it was" = "原件保留在原處";
"The scope is different. iPhone Storage includes apps and system data, while this app reports authorized content and may estimate media sizes when originals are in iCloud." = "範圍不同。 iPhone 儲存包括應用程式和系統數據，而此應用程式會報告授權內容，並可能在原件位於 iCloud 中時估計媒體大小。";
"These actions happen outside the app" = "這些操作發生在應用程式外部";
"Three focused tools" = "三个重点工具";
"Understand System Data" = "瞭解系統資料";
"Understand optimized photos" = "了解優化照片";
"Understand the three tools and what each one can access." = "瞭解三個工具及其存取範圍。";
"Use Apple's controls for attachments, history, and website data." = "使用 Apple 的控制項管理附件、歷史記錄與網站資料。";
"Use Convert" = "使用轉換";
"Use Media" = "使用媒體";
"Use Settings > Apps > Safari to clear history and website data. This can close tabs or sign you out of websites, so save anything important first." = "使用「設定」>「應用程式」>「Safari」來清除歷史記錄和網站資料。這可能會關閉選項卡或使您退出網站，因此請先儲存重要的內容。";
"Use Storage" = "使用儲存空間";
"Use Storage deletion carefully" = "謹慎使用儲存刪除";
"Use iPhone Storage or the conversation details in Messages to review large attachments. With Messages in iCloud, deletion syncs across your devices; Recently Deleted can continue using space." = "使用 iPhone 儲存空間或「訊息」中的對話詳細資訊來查看大型配件。透過 iCloud 中的訊息，刪除可以在您的裝置之間同步；最近刪除可以繼續使用空間。";
"Use the right tool" = "使用正確的工具";
"What happens with Limited Photos Access?" = "限制照片存取會發生什麼？";
"What the app cannot see" = "應用程式看不到的內容";
"When iCloud Photos is on, deleting a photo or video removes it from other devices signed in to the same Apple Account." = "當 iCloud 照片開啟時，刪除照片或影片會將其從登入相同 Apple 帳戶的其他裝置中刪除。";
"Why did free space not update immediately?" = "為什麼可用空間沒有立即更新？";
"Why is the analyzed size different from iPhone Storage?" = "為什麼分析的大小與 iPhone 儲存大小不同？";
"Why the number changes" = "數字為何變化";
"Why totals can differ" = "為什麼總數可能不同";
"Why was an iCloud file skipped?" = "為什麼 iCloud 檔案被跳過？";
"With Optimize iPhone Storage enabled, some originals remain in iCloud while smaller versions stay on the device. Media size can therefore be an estimate until the original is available." = "啟用優化 iPhone 儲存空間後，某些原始版本會保留在 iCloud 中，而較小的版本會保留在裝置上。因此，在獲得原件之前，介質尺寸只能是估計值。";
"You choose the scan scope" = "您選擇掃描範圍";
"Your choices stay in control" = "選擇權始終由你掌控";
"iCloud Photos syncs deletions" = "iCloud 照片同步刪除";
"iOS does not let one app browse another app's private files, system caches, or the entire iPhone file system. When a category is outside the app's access, Help shows the safe system path instead." = "iOS 不允許一個應用程式瀏覽另一個應用程式的私人檔案、系統快取或整個 iPhone 檔案系統。當某個類別超出應用程式的存取權限時，「幫助」將顯示安全系統路徑。";
"iOS keeps each app's documents and caches private. Use iPhone Storage and the controls inside each app instead." = "iOS 將每個應用程式的文件和快取保密。請改用 iPhone 儲存和每個應用程式內的控制。";
"iPhone Storage measures space on this device. iCloud storage measures data kept in your iCloud account. Freeing one does not always free the other." = "iPhone 儲存空間測量此裝置上的空間。 iCloud 儲存可測量儲存在您的 iCloud 帳戶中的資料。釋放一個人並不總是能釋放另一個人。";
"Display Options" = "顯示選項";
"Interface Animations" = "介面動畫";
"Show Media Dates" = "顯示媒體日期";
"Control dashboard animations and date headings in media detail grids." = "控制媒體「我的空間」、儲存旭日圖、轉換卡片動畫，以及媒體詳細網格中的日期標題。";
"Calculating size…" = "正在計算大小…";
"Size unavailable" = "大小無法取得";
"Quick Cleanup" = "快速清理";
"Review Cleanup Suggestions" = "檢查清理建議";
"Select one or more categories. Similar-photo groups always keep the recommended photo." = "選擇一個或多個分類。相似照片群組始終保留建議照片。";
"Sizes are approximate. Categories can overlap, and selected items are counted once." = "大小為估算值。分類可能重疊，所選項目只計算一次。";
"%lld items selected" = "已選擇 %lld 項";
"Approximately %@" = "約 %@";
"Clean Up" = "清理";
"Cleanup Complete" = "清理完成";
"The selected items will move to Recently Deleted and may not free space immediately." = "所選項目將移至「最近刪除」，空間可能不會立即釋放。";
"No Cleanup Suggestions" = "暫無清理建議";
"Run media analysis first to create safe cleanup categories." = "請先分析媒體，以建立安全的清理分類。";
"Analyze Media" = "分析媒體";
"Analyzing media…" = "正在分析媒體…";
"Selected" = "已選擇";
"Not selected" = "未選擇";
"Selects or deselects every suggested item in this category." = "選擇或取消選擇此分類中的所有建議項目。";
"%@ moved to Recently Deleted · ~%@" = "%@ 已移至「最近刪除」 · 約 %@";
"Allow photo access, then wait for the library to load." = "允許取用照片，然後等待圖庫載入完成。";
"Analyze the available library and let the app group useful cleanup candidates." = "分析可用圖庫，讓 App 整理出值得檢查的清理候選項目。";
"Preview items at full size and compare similar photos carefully." = "以完整尺寸預覽項目，並仔細比較相似照片。";
"Select only unwanted items and approve the Photos deletion request." = "只選擇不需要的項目，然後核准「照片」的刪除要求。";
"Pick a folder in Files or a supported file provider." = "在「檔案」或支援的檔案供應商中選擇資料夾。";
"The app reads file metadata and reports inaccessible or unavailable cloud items separately." = "App 會讀取檔案中繼資料，並分別報告無法存取或暫時無法使用的雲端項目。";
"Use the folder map, categories, and detailed lists to find large files." = "使用資料夾地圖、類別和詳細列表尋找大型檔案。";
"Confirm the file and location, then delete only content you no longer need." = "確認文件和位置，然後只刪除不再需要的內容。";
"Open image, video, audio, or video-to-audio conversion." = "開啟影像、視訊、音訊或視訊到音訊轉換。";
"Select supported items from Photos or Files and wait for the working copies to finish importing." = "從照片或文件中選擇支援的項目，然後等待工作副本完成匯入。";
"Choose the format and available size, quality, or metadata options." = "選擇格式，以及可用的尺寸、品質或中繼資料選項。";
"Keep the task open until each item completes or reports an error." = "保持任務打開，直到每個項目完成或報告錯誤。";
"Use the share action to save or send completed output before clearing the workspace." = "清除工作區前，使用分享操作儲存或傳送完成的輸出。";
"Go to Settings > General > iPhone Storage and wait for the category chart to finish calculating." = "前往“設定”>“一般”>“iPhone 儲存體”，然後等待類別圖表完成計算。";
"Start with Photos, apps, Messages, or downloads that can make a meaningful difference." = "從可以產生有意義的變化的照片、應用程式、訊息或下載開始。";
"Use Media for your authorized Photos library, Storage for a selected folder, and the system guide for everything else." = "將媒體用於您的授權照片庫，將儲存用於選定的資料夾，並將系統指南用於其他所有內容。";
"Recently Deleted and system storage calculations can delay the visible change. Do not rely on a fixed update time." = "「最近刪除」和系統儲存空間重新計算都可能延遲可見變化，請勿依賴固定的更新時間。";
